  "title": "Al-Zahrawi's Kitab al-Tasrif",
  "summary": "Al-Zahrawi, known in the West as Albucasis (936–1013), compiled the Kitab al-Tasrif, a 30-volume work on medicine and surgery. It was completed about 1000 CE after roughly fifty years of practice. It was illustrated with surgical procedures and instruments, some of his own invention.",
